<title>USA: Com/Tech faces shareholder class action suit.</title>
<headline>Com/Tech faces shareholder class action suit.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Com/Tech Communications Technologies Inc said on Thursday a purported class action suit had been filed against it and a director in a New York state court.</p>
<p>The lawsuit alleged certain violations of U.S. securities law in connection with Com/Tech's initial public offering in August 1995, the company said.</p>
<p>Com/Tech said it believed it had no liability for the claims against it in the lawsuit, and it intended to defend itself vigorously.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
